set/2186/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2186/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2186/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2186/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2186/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2186/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Obsidian.jpg","The cybersecurity space has been experiencing a paradigm shift. With more and more organizations entrusting SaaS applications with highly sensitive business data, business owners are realizing that protecting sensitive SaaS data is an increasingly critical need. Attacks against this data are dynamic, affecting both third-party integrations and cross-application connections. Unfortunately, security teams often lack the tools, time, resources and experience to confidently protect their organization’s critical services.\r\n\r\nThankfully, Obsidian Security has entered the fray to tackle this urgent situation. Obsidian is the first truly comprehensive security and compliance solution built with the express aim of protecting SaaS applications. By analyzing state and activity data within and across business-critical applications, Obsidian helps enterprise security teams manage privilege and access, harden configurations, and identify compromised accounts. Obsidian’s holistic approach to SaaS security goes beyond typical authentication and proxies, providing diagnostic results and actionable recommendations within minutes. Though it’s already had a monumental impact on the security landscape, we can’t wait to discover the other ways in which this fast-growing startup will change the world of SaaS.","Obsidian is a comprehensive security solution for protecting SaaS app